TEXT -160 -336 Left 5 ;Right Generator has field voltage at startup\nLeft Generator has field voltage after 500ms\nBoth AVR are on after 1s, speed controller is on from start\nLoadstep after 2s with 5000W active load and 2000W reactive load\nleft with serial load and right with parallel load\nLeft AVR is new model AVR_50Hz without ripples\nRight AVR has ripples (which causes also the speed to ripple)\nHINT: You can increase the integration part and decrease the\nproportional part to get smaller ripples !!
TEXT -664 16 Left 2 !.options vntol=100m abstol=1m reltol=0.003\n.param Rgnd=1e6\n.param tdv=1 tdt=1 fn1=50 omega_n={2*pi*fn1}
